The second weekly meeting of the Sagebrush Literary and Musical Society was
held last Saturday evening at the residence
of Miss Rose Kind. The following pro-
gram was rendered: Opening Song, Club;
Roll call; Quotations; Discussion on Whit-
tier, Club; Sentimental Solo, Rose Kind;
Reading, May Mowen; Recitation, Pearl
Norman; Vocal Solo, Annie A. Looney;
Recitation, Grace N. Jackson; Reading,
Flossie Ford; Reading, Helen Whitmore;
Vocal Duet, Misses Read and Phillips;
Recitation, Edith Swick; Reading, Mrs.
H. A. McKim; Guitar Duet, Misses Jack-
son and Mannheim; Conundrums, Flora
Lane; Charades, Daisy Davis; Closing
Song, Club.

